<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Access Health downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Access Health downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns downgraded Access Health Inc to attractive from buy, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock fell 2-1/4 to 56.</p>
</text>
